(The input features are:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(age, sex, cp, trestbps, chol, fbs, restecg, thalach, exang, oldpeak, slope, ca, and thal.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The dataset is small, so the project uses stratified splitting and cross-validation. This) Tj T*
(preserves the approximate class ratio in training and validation partitions. The model) Tj T*
(should not be interpreted as a clinical diagnostic system: the dataset is limited in size) Tj T*
(and scope, and a real medical application would require external validation, clinical) Tj T*
(review, calibration, and regulatory controls.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. EXPLORATORY DATA ANALYSIS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The EDA script creates:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Feature distribution plots to identify scale differences and unusual values.) Tj T*
(- A correlation heatmap to inspect linear relationships.) Tj T*
(- A class-balance chart to show target proportions.) Tj T*
(- A JSON summary for repeatable numerical inspection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(EDA informs the design without becoming a source of leakage. The target is not used to fit) Tj T*
(imputers or scalers. The generated files are:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- outputs/eda/feature_distributions.png) Tj T*
(- outputs/eda/correlation_heatmap.png) Tj T*
(- outputs/eda/class_balance.png) Tj T*
(- outputs/eda/summary.json) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(These outputs should be included in the final submission under evidence/ or linked from the) Tj T*
(report after capturing the final repository state.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. FEATURE ENGINEERING AND MODEL DEVELOPMENT) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The model pipeline divides variables into numeric and categorical groups. Numeric columns) Tj T*
(use median imputation followed by standard scaling. Categorical columns use most-frequent) Tj T*
(imputation followed by one-hot encoding with unknown-category handling. The classifier is) Tj T*
(attached to the same ColumnTransformer pipeline.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This design was selected for three reasons:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Median imputation is robust to a small number of missing clinical measurements.) Tj T*
(2. Scaling supports Logistic Regression optimization and prevents large-unit variables from) Tj T*
(dominating the regularized objective.) Tj T*
(3. One-hot encoding makes categorical values usable by scikit-learn estimators while) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
