(handle_unknown="ignore" protects the API from an unseen category.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Two models are trained:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Logistic Regression: a transparent linear baseline with stable probabilities.) Tj T*
(- Random Forest: a nonlinear ensemble that can capture interactions and threshold effects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Five-fold stratified cross-validation is used for comparison. The primary selection metric) Tj T*
(is cross-validation ROC-AUC because it evaluates ranking quality across thresholds.) Tj T*
(Accuracy, precision, and recall are also reported because they describe different) Tj T*
(operational trade-offs.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. RESULTS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The selected model in the current artifact is Logistic Regression. The recorded results are:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(   Evaluation    Accuracy    Precision    Recall    ROC-AUC) Tj T*
(  ---  ---:  ---:  ---:  ---:) Tj T*
(   5-fold cross-validation    0.8471    0.8768    0.7834    0.9025) Tj T*
(   Holdout test set    0.8852    0.8387    0.9286    0.9665) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The holdout recall is higher than the cross-validation recall. This is expected from a) Tj T*
(single finite split and is why the cross-validation result is used for model selection) Tj T*
(rather than relying on one holdout number. These results demonstrate a functioning) Tj T*
(educational classifier; they do not establish clinical performance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The artifact metadata records the model name, MLflow run identifier, dataset hash, feature) Tj T*
(count, selection metric, and evaluation metrics. This makes the deployed model traceable to) Tj T*
(a specific training input and experiment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. MLFLOW EXPERIMENT TRACKING AND REPRODUCIBILITY) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Each training run logs:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Model and preprocessing parameters.) Tj T*
(- Cross-validation and holdout metrics.) Tj T*
(- Evaluation plots.) Tj T*
(- Dataset hash.) Tj T*
(- The selected model artifact and metadata.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The local file tracking store is mlruns/. A dataset hash is recorded so a future run can) Tj T*
(identify whether the input data changed. The reproducible training sequence is:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
