(The model is saved as artifacts/model.joblib. Saving the complete pipeline, rather than only) Tj T*
(the classifier, is essential because inference must repeat imputation, scaling, and encoding) Tj T*
(exactly as training did.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. API IMPLEMENTATION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The FastAPI service provides:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- GET /health: returns 200 when the model artifact is loaded and 503 when it is unavailable.) Tj T*
(- POST /predict: validates one 13-feature JSON payload and returns a binary prediction,) Tj T*
(confidence, and model version.) Tj T*
(- GET /metrics: returns Prometheus-compatible request counters and latency histograms.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Pydantic request model rejects unknown fields and applies reasonable range checks. The) Tj T*
(API middleware records HTTP method, path, status, and latency. It intentionally does not log) Tj T*
(raw patient features.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Example local request:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(bash) Tj T*
(curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict \\) Tj T*
(  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\) Tj T*
(  -d '{"age":63,"sex":1,"cp":3,"trestbps":145,"chol":233,"fbs":1,"restecg":0,"thalach":150,") Tj T*
(exang":0,"oldpeak":2.3,"slope":0,"ca":0,"thal":1}') Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For local operation:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(bash) Tj T*
(uvicorn app.api:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000) Tj T*
(curl http://127.0.0.1:8000/health) Tj T*
(curl http://127.0.0.1:8000/metrics) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. TESTING AND CONTINUOUS INTEGRATION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
