(The test suite covers:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- Required data columns and target conversion.) Tj T*
(- Preprocessor construction and transformations.) Tj T*
(- Model training and prediction behavior.) Tj T*
(- API health and prediction responses.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The CI workflow performs linting, downloads data, prepares data, generates EDA outputs,) Tj T*
(trains the model, runs Pytest, builds the Docker image, and uploads artifacts. This ordering) Tj T*
(catches failures before a deployment image is published.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Recommended local validation:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(bash) Tj T*
(python -m ruff check app scripts tests) Tj T*
(python -m pytest -q) Tj T*
(docker build -t heart-disease-api:local .) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. CONTAINERIZATION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Docker image installs the pinned project dependencies, copies the app/ package and) Tj T*
(trained artifacts/, and starts Uvicorn on port 8000. The model artifact must be present in) Tj T*
(the image; otherwise the service correctly reports 503 from /health rather than claiming) Tj T*
(readiness.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The deployment workflow therefore trains and verifies artifacts/model.joblib before the) Tj T*
(Docker build. The image name is lowercase because Docker and GHCR reject uppercase) Tj T*
(repository components:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(text) Tj T*
(ghcr.io/explore-ai-engg/heart-disease-api) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Before deploying a new image, verify the artifact directly:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(bash) Tj T*
(docker run --rm --entrypoint sh heart-disease-api:local \\) Tj T*
(  -c 'test -f /app/artifacts/model.joblib && ls -lh /app/artifacts') Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10. KUBERNETES AND DEPLOYMENT STATUS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
