(The Kubernetes manifest defines a Deployment named heart-disease-api and a Service for) Tj T*
(external access. The Deployment uses a readiness check against /health, so traffic is not) Tj T*
(sent to a pod before the model is loaded.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(An earlier GKE rollout returned 503 from /health and entered CrashLoopBackOff. That was a) Tj T*
(real failure signal and was not used as successful evidence. Investigation showed that the) Tj T*
(single e2-small node could not schedule the replacement pod because the previous resource) Tj T*
(requests were too large for available memory. The deployment was corrected by using a) Tj T*
(Recreate strategy, lower resource requests, and a startup probe. The corrected rollout) Tj T*
(completed successfully.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. The workflow ran for the branch that was pushed.) Tj T*
(2. The build context contains artifacts/model.joblib.) Tj T*
(3. The pushed image digest is the image used by the Deployment.) Tj T*
(4. The pod can read /app/artifacts/model.joblib.) Tj T*
(5. The pod logs identify any model-loading exception.) Tj T*
(6. The Deployment reaches 1/1 ready replicas before the external URL is tested.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The deployment workflow has been updated to run on both main and master, to train before) Tj T*
(building, and to print diagnostics only when a rollout step fails. A public API URL should) Tj T*
(be added to this report only after all of the following succeed:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(bash) Tj T*
(kubectl rollout status deployment/heart-disease-api --timeout=180s) Tj T*
(kubectl get service heart-disease-api) Tj T*
(curl http://EXTERNAL_IP/health) Tj T*
(curl -X POST http://EXTERNAL_IP/predict -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d '...') Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The verified public service is:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(text) Tj T*
(http://104.154.36.8:8000) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Observed Kubernetes state after the fix:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(text) Tj T*
(deployment/heart-disease-api: 1/1 available) Tj T*
(pod: heart-disease-api-6d655b99b7-lcpfl  1/1 Running) Tj T*
(service: LoadBalancer  EXTERNAL-IP 104.154.36.8) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
