(11. MONITORING, LOGGING, PRIVACY, AND SECURITY) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Prometheus counters measure request totals by endpoint and status. A latency histogram) Tj T*
(records request duration. These signals can be scraped by Prometheus and visualized in) Tj T*
(Grafana, or inspected directly through /metrics.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Operational logging includes method, route, status, and latency. It does not include the) Tj T*
(JSON body. This reduces accidental exposure of health information in logs. Production) Tj T*
(hardening would additionally require authentication, TLS, network policy, secret management,) Tj T*
(rate limiting, audit controls, and a formal privacy review.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GitHub Actions authenticates to Google Cloud using Workload Identity Federation rather than) Tj T*
(a long-lived service-account key. The provider secret must contain the full provider) Tj T*
(resource name without a https:// or //iam.googleapis.com/ prefix.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(12. REPRODUCTION GUIDE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(bash) Tj T*
(git clone https://github.com/Explore-AI-Engg/MLOPS.git) Tj T*
(cd heart-disease-mlops) Tj T*
(python3 -m venv .venv) Tj T*
(source .venv/bin/activate) Tj T*
(python -m pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj T*
(python -m scripts.download_data) Tj T*
(python -m scripts.prepare_data) Tj T*
(python -m scripts.eda) Tj T*
ET
endstream
