() Tj T*
(14. LIMITATIONS AND FUTURE IMPROVEMENTS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The dataset is small, historical, and not sufficient for clinical deployment. Future work) Tj T*
(should add external validation, calibration, subgroup analysis, threshold selection based on) Tj T*
(clinical cost, drift monitoring, model registry promotion rules, authenticated API access,) Tj T*
(TLS, and managed observability.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The current project demonstrates the engineering lifecycle and reproducibility controls) Tj T*
(expected in an MLOps assignment. It should not be represented as a medical device or used to) Tj T*
(make patient-care decisions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CONCLUSION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This repository demonstrates an end-to-end, reproducible ML workflow: scripted data) Tj T*
(acquisition, explicit preprocessing, model comparison, MLflow tracking, automated tests,) Tj T*
